  "citation": "Steele L P; Krummel P B; Langenfelds R L (2003): Atmospheric H2 Concentrations from the CSIRO GASLAB Flask Sampling Network. CDIAC. Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/ATG.040",
  "dataset": {
    "@context": "http://schema.org/",
